{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the sequence of numbers defined recursively by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae496655b4dded171d28728bc08bf3a6943e868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/65262bf247c4a3c6114a8223d249dc9702619d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/7/a3754938e6fa2bce33eaf6204d7c487bc38ac9e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_n=1+t_{(n/2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"112\" height=\"19\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even \nand by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/1/af15da1c2554d4e4d8be32d979aa5afa70941068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_n=\\frac{1}{t_{(n-1)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"89\" height=\"44\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e3cbc9234e0b79e5d97fe52d61ce43aa8c76148.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_n=\\frac{19}{87}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />, the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420f6a1af4b686a412f95ce2b55fbb23eaa91fb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 17 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 19 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 21 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc8d4e7ca8c782aff5cf99b78d8324667c51321.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_{(n/2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"17\" /> would be negative, which is not possible. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd. With this function, backwards thinking is the key. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/7/3b725a0c4fa64e66f0b6208859c17e84f0538d58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_x &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/a/ddad3b77e8585d95fc9073027f988d2c0468b5d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_{(x-1)} = \\frac{1}{t_{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"83\" height=\"39\" />. Otherwise, you keep on subtracting 1 and halving x until <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/8/de8eca8b59783e9ef22650f354f0c87cb1cc09cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_\\frac{x}{2^{n}} &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />.\nWe can use this logic to go backwards until we reach <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e8ee18e68e9c155121ada814c084c6b21f79e9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, like so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/1/641657a6cee6138f655915b19fd04843cca4f21b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_n=\\frac{19}{87}\\\\\\\\t_{n-1} = \\frac{87}{19}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{n-1}{2}} = \\frac{68}{19}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{n-1}{4}} = \\frac{49}{19}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{n-1}{8}} = \\frac{30}{19}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{n-1}{16}} = \\frac{11}{19}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1} = \\frac{19}{11}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2}} = \\frac{8}{11}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1} = \\frac{11}{8}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2}} = \\frac{3}{8}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} - 1} = \\frac{8}{3}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} - 1}{2}} = \\frac{5}{3}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} - 1}{4}} = \\frac{2}{3}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} - 1}{4} - 1} = \\frac{3}{2}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} - 1}{4} - 1}{2}} = \\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} - 1}{4} - 1}{2} - 1} = 2\\\\\\\\t_{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} - 1}{4} - 1}{2} - 1}{2}} = t_1 = 1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{\\frac{n-1}{16} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} - 1}{4} - 1}{2} - 1}{2} = 1 \\Rightarrow n = 1905$\" style=\"vertical-align: -44px\" width=\"496\" height=\"904\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/c/4dc1c525d092e84b0286864a6e5eedb07605433d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"59\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></sp